---
description: Android development
alwaysApply: true
---

Use:
- Jetpack ViewModel
- Navigation Component
- Hilt (this project)
- Room
- Retrofit
- Glide

Prefer:
- StateFlow for UI state
- collectAsStateWithLifecycle
- repeatOnLifecycle
- Jetpack Compose for new screens
- Material 3

Avoid deprecated Android APIs.
Always recommend official AndroidX libraries first.
Use Dependency Injection with Hilt in this project.
Follow Google's Android Architecture Guidelines.

No XML unless explicitly requested.
Do not migrate existing Compose screens to XML.
